    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 413 of the Code is amended by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection: “(5) Notwithstanding the preceding subsections, where the property is required for the investigation of a case and it is necessary for the property to be detained, the property shall be kept in a safe and proper place by the Officer in charge of a Police District where the offence was committed.”. Amendment of section 426"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 426 of the Code is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) The Court before which an accused is convicted of an offence may, in its discretion, make an order for the payment by the convicted accused of the cost of his prosecution or any part thereof as may be agreed by the Public Prosecutor.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsections: “(1a) Without prejudice to subsection (1), the Court before which an accused is convicted of an offence shall, upon the application of the Public Prosecutor, make an order against the convicted accused for the payment by him, or where the convicted accused is a child, by his parent or guardian, of a sum to be fixed by the Court as compensation to a person who is the victim of the offence committed by the convicted accused in respect of the injury to his person or character, or loss of his income or property, as a result of the offence committed. ( 1b) Where the person who is the victim of the offence is deceased, the order of compensation shall be made to a representative of the deceased person. ( 1C) The Court shall, in making an order under subsection (1a), take into consideration the following factors: (a) the nature of the offence; (b) the injury sustained by the victim; (c) the expenses incurred by the victim; (d) the damage to, or loss of, property suffered by the victim; (e) the loss of income incurred by the victim; (f) the ability of the convicted accused to pay; and (g) any other factors which the Court deems relevant. ( 1d) For the purpose of making an order under subsection (1a), the Court may hold an inquiry as it thinks fit.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (4), by deleting the words “crime or”. Amendment of section 428"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/17/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
